              <items xsi:type="form:FormField">
                <name>AllowToSaveResults</name>
                <id>227</id>
                <title>
                  <key>en</key>
                  <value>Allow saving positive results</value>
                </title>
                <title>
                  <key>fa</key>
                  <value>اجازه ذخیره نتایج مثبت</value>
                </title>
                <title>
                  <key>ru</key>
                  <value>Разрешить сохранение положительных результатов</value>
                </title>
                <title>
                  <key>tr</key>
                  <value>Olumlu sonuçların kaydedilmesine izin ver</value>
                </title>
                <title>
                  <key>it</key>
                  <value>Allow saving positive results</value>
                </title>
                <title>
                  <key>pl</key>
                  <value>Allow saving positive results</value>
                </title>
                <title>
                  <key>vi</key>
                  <value>Allow saving positive results</value>
                </title>
                <visible>true</visible>
                <enabled>true</enabled>
                <userVisible>
                  <common>true</common>
                </userVisible>
                <dataPath xsi:type="form:DataPath">
                  <segments>AllowToSaveResults</segments>
                </dataPath>
                <titleLocation>Right</titleLocation>
                <toolTip>
                  <key>en</key>
                  <value>When the option is enabled, you can save positive results from previous approval cycles. 
Employees who have approved the document will not receive repeated requests. The program will offer to repeat the approval only to those who have not yet approved.</value>
                </toolTip>
                <toolTip>
                  <key>fa</key>
                  <value>با فعال بودن این گزینه، می‌توانید نتایج مثبت چرخه‌های تأیید قبلی را ذخیره کنید. 
کارکنانی که سند را تأیید کرده‌اند درخواست تکراری دریافت نخواهند کرد. برنامه تکرار تأیید را فقط به کسانی پیشنهاد می‌دهد که هنوز تأیید نکرده‌اند.</value>
                </toolTip>
                <toolTip>
                  <key>ru</key>
                  <value>При включённой опции можно сохранить положительные результаты предыдущих циклов согласования. 
Сотрудники, согласовавшие документ, не будут получать повторные запросы — программа предложит повторить согласование только тем, кто ещё не согласовал.</value>
                </toolTip>
                <toolTip>
                  <key>tr</key>
                  <value>Seçenek etkinleştirildiğinde, önceki onay döngülerinin olumlu sonuçları kaydedilebilir. 
 Belgeyi onaylayan çalışanlar tekrar talep almayacak. Program yalnızca henüz onaylamayanlara onayı tekrarlamayı önerecektir.</value>
                </toolTip>
                <toolTip>
                  <key>it</key>
                  <value>When the option is enabled, you can save positive results from previous approval cycles. 
Employees who have approved the document will not receive repeated requests. The program will offer to repeat the approval only to those who have not yet approved.</value>
                </toolTip>
                <toolTip>
                  <key>pl</key>
                  <value>When the option is enabled, you can save positive results from previous approval cycles. 
Employees who have approved the document will not receive repeated requests. The program will offer to repeat the approval only to those who have not yet approved.</value>
                </toolTip>
                <toolTip>
                  <key>vi</key>
                  <value>When the option is enabled, you can save positive results from previous approval cycles. 
Employees who have approved the document will not receive repeated requests. The program will offer to repeat the approval only to those who have not yet approved.</value>
                </toolTip>
                <toolTipRepresentation>Button</toolTipRepresentation>
